# Alembic migrations

Run from `apps/api` (or `uv run --directory apps/api alembic ...`).

## Commands

```bash
# once
uv add --package api alembic "psycopg[binary]"
uv run --directory apps/api alembic init alembic

# after SQLModel changes in packages/storage
uv run --directory apps/api alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
uv run --directory apps/api alembic upgrade head
```

## Never

- Create new files under `alembic/versions/` by hand
- Paste raw SQL migrations without `revision --autogenerate` first
- Edit `upgrade()` without a model change driving autogenerate (review autogenerated output only when autogenerate misses something)
